Aerie-Purpose: Add a settings handler that lists, and removes, the sites the user allowed over plain HTTP.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings (new aerie_hardening_handler, registered in settings_ui.cc)
Aerie-Kind: hook

The HTTPS-only warning page already stores a per-site exception (the HTTP_ALLOWED content
setting). Nothing in settings listed them. This handler reads and clears that setting.

